{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10005_01_j",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:55815a54d0dd77bde91ed7b5e2565c8a97780c05d2ff4d962121966b7cfa8536",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_j:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1bbb07cdd98550016f2527398106833de68db85e09208d6bb91983f346f5d2e8",
      "text": "活动当天",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_j:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:efee618a16ca86fc3b516982225ec8d9f8f5a181c8e79cd500045bf7f43a4e0a",
      "text": "情人节限定巧克力“结-yui-”，\n是与著名糕点屋的联名巧克力♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_j:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b2f0f9fddbfab3b23e1acfe35de21c78727ba84a80ebabc0c7ead7f8629aa5a",
      "text": "只要尝上一口，呀真奇妙！\n整个人都会飘飘然变得幸福起来喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_j:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c92dcca89d87dc8dc02b80e75f16cb043a043b34ad64884b173abe75072c361",
      "text": "充满了和风风味，每尝一口，\n都会化作“难以忘怀的滋味”吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_j:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:145881ac897a41ad4209dacee1a8064ad2832a797ca1d190268c15a66cf0a497",
      "text": "因为是期间限定发售，\n感兴趣的客人请务必尽早购买。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_j:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a208e36818c1405d69e81d25e4c85d1b9d21d903c25e523f71a7a29dae632f5f",
      "text": "虽然“结-yui-”是期间限定，\n但在便利店也能轻松买到哦♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_j:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ddb65c179226b03f22398800c5c790aee5c1a732f9409defdde1933457c7c83a",
      "text": "不仅是恋人，给家人和朋友们，\n也请用这款巧克力传达爱与感谢吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_j:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97d8e05c9226b05aee361433cc63893b54cae2b0b85ed7ce081ad9d5f5d27b86",
      "text": "说起感谢……九郎君、蝶蝶小姐。\n差不多该进入那个谈话主题了喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_j:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87c7b2bc8b60d85d63c332b9bc6c1edd13dfebebdce6a294e17f6b63488266bb",
      "text": "是的。其实前些天，我和猫柳先生还有华村先生\n一起去了女仆咖啡厅……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_j:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b2776ab1487492cdbc90bc67c59168551a930cc4dcbe6e367dcb25dec21138a",
      "text": "诶，彩的三个人居然去女仆咖啡厅！\n感觉挺意外的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_j:cmd-000140:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9de0664521fdaeebccca9f7d7ccc316c53a7e31448b4ca72fb8642c7126b25b",
      "text": "（太好了，完全抓住客人们的注意力了！\n大家，保持这股势头加油吧！）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
